{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Controlling the Story"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Prep for the Press Conference"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Exchange information using a wider range of language."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing Opinions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Expressing an opinion is different than stating a fact. You may believe something or have a strong feeling about it based on your understanding. However, you need to communicate that your opinion is just your own and that others may feel or believe differently."}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are certain expressions which are used to indicate that you are about to express your opinion. <br />By <span class=\"strong\">prefacing</span> (giving a short introduction before) your opinion you will appear to be open to other people's ideas while letting others consider your own. These may be expressed positively or negatively, with certainty or uncertainty, depending on how you feel. You will notice that most of the expressions are <span class=\"strong\">neutral</span> - they do not express certainty or uncertainty, which is usual in expressing opinions. However, there are times you will want to indicate a strong opinion or that you really have not made up your mind. <br />Depending on your <span class=\"strong\">tone of voice</span>, or the rest of your sentence, the same expressions can sometimes indicate a different degree of certainty."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":11,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Certainty\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Neither Certain nor Uncertain\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Uncertainty or Hesitation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am sure/certain/believe ...\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm not sure/certain, but ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I say ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would/wouldn't say ...\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"As far as I'm concerned ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I get/have the feeling ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I get/have the feeling ...\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I get/have the impression ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I have the impression ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Honestly/Truthfully/To be honest ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It seems/looks to me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It seems/looks to me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I find/don't find that ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I find/don't find that ...\\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm not sure that ...\\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I think/don't think ...\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"In my opinion/view/eyes ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"In my opinion\\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I sense that ...\\\"}\",\"\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">I sense that</span> you are feeling uncomfortable.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">I'm not sure but I think</span> that the market has changed.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">In my opinion</span>, that is not a very good idea.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">I'm not sure that</span> your argument is going to be convincing like that.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">It looks to me</span> like we're moving forward.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">I find that</span> the restaurant is not very clean.</span> <br /><span class=\"italic\">*(stating a fact about the restaurant declares <span class=\"underline\">certainty</span>) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">I find</span> the menu appealing.</span><br /><span class=\"italic\">*(stating a personal taste for something does not indicate that others will find it appealing, so it is a <span class=\"underline\">neutral</span> statement)"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Using Adjectives with <span class=\"italic\">\u2018-ing'</span> and <span class=\"italic\">\u2018-ed'</span> to Describe Feelings and Impressions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Sometimes we get an overall sense of a situation, which is called an impression. An impression gives a feeling. Strong emotions about something are also called feelings. We use adjectives to describe these feelings and impressions. Very often the adjective is formed by adding an <span class=\"italic\">\u2018ed'</span> or <span class=\"italic\">\u2018ing'</span> to the verb that is used to cause these emotions, but not always."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Both the verbs <span class=\"strong\">to be</span> and <span class=\"strong\">feel</span> can be used with these adjectives."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Using to be makes the statement a little stronger and more personal. It makes the adjective seem more emotional."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Using the adjective after feel makes the feeling more of an impression. For instance: \u2018I am distressed' is more emotional and personal than \u2018I feel distressed'."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The film <span class=\\\"underline\\\">excites</span> me.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am/feel <span class=\\\"underline\\\">excited</span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The film is <span class=\\\"underline\\\">exciting</span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The news <span class=\\\"underline\\\">disturbs</span> us.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We are/feel <span class=\\\"underline\\\">disturbed</span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The news is <span class=\\\"underline\\\">disturbing</span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"This meeting <span class=\\\"underline\\\">bores</span> me.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am/feel <span class=\\\"underline\\\">bored</span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The meeting is <span class=\\\"underline\\\">boring</span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"This situation <span class=\\\"underline\\\">confuses</span> me.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"This situation is <span class=\\\"underline\\\">confusing</span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am/feel <span class=\\\"underline\\\">confused</span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"That music wracks my nerves!\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"That music is nerve-wracking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am/feel <span class=\\\"underline\\\">nerve-wracked</span>. (incorrect!)\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are other adjectives of feeling as well, and they may carry endings such as \u2018ive' or \u2018able'."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am/feel <span class=\\\"underline\\\">sensitive</span> about that.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am/feel <span class=\\\"underline\\\">apprehensive.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I feel <span class=\\\"underline\\\">horrible.</span></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about feelings and impressions."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "personal"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "able to affect you as a person"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This one is somehow different. More personal."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le09ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "appalled"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "shocked about something terrible"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I felt appalled at the news."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le09ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "believable"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having a quality that can be believed"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: As far as I'm concerned, that won't be believable."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le09ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "distressed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very upset and worried"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was distressed at hearing that we are complicit with child labor."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le09ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "troubled"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "concerned by something wrong"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I felt troubled at hearing we are complicit with child labor."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le09ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "relatable"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having a quality that you can connect with"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Tell what is happening in a way that people will find relatable."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le09ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Invent a work situation that you might have a strong opinion and feelings about."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down adjectives that describe your feelings and impressions about the situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write several sentences that describe your opinions, using expressions that demonstrate certainty and uncertainty."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your impressions and opinions to your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about your opinions and impressions about the other person's situation."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I describe my feelings and impressions about a particular work situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express certainty and uncertainty about a particular work situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write my impressions and opinions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my impressions and opinions with a partner."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn8le09ob09re1img01.jpg"}], "labs": [{"exerc