"}]}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn8le09ob09re7pdf01.pdf"}]}]}], "type": "DWS", "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Let's be honest about how we feel."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le09ob09re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le09ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le09ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "00", "image": "engenn8le09ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: I get the impression you find this press conference nerve wracking.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Honestly, I've never been so nervous about a press conference before.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Me neither. This one is somehow different. More personal. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: Personal. Hang onto that word, Miranda. I want to talk through some steps in preparing for a press report. The first point is to come up with a list of adjectives to describe the company. For instance, what is the image you are wanting to project?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Personal is good!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Sensitive and caring?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: As far as I'm concerned, that won't be believable. Not when you're seen as supporting human rights abuses. How did you feel at the news?", "id": 1}, {"time": "37000", "image": "engenn8le09ob09re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Troubled, distressed ...\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Shocked, appalled ...\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: I'd say that's better. Secondly, come up with one main point you want your audience to hear and stick with it.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: We want to help the community of Shalopolis\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: I'm not sure the public will find that credible. <br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: It's true.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Janet, how about: We are outraged about being deceived and made complicit in human rights abuses?", "id": 2}, {"time": "60500", "image": "engenn8le09ob09re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: I find that an big improvement. Now, choose your main speaker and one person to answer questions.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Miranda, I think you'd do better than I would. And, to be honest, I don't trust Farmani.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: Next, create the story. I mean, tell what is happening in a way that people will find personable and relatable. Then, come up with list of questions you may be asked and your responses.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: That's some real preparation for us Janet!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: And don't forget to do a mock run-through.", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}